functions:

agents: A B s

knowledge: 
A knows A B s sk(A,s).
B knows A B s sk(B,s).
s knows A B s sk(A,s) sk(B,s).

choreo:
A: new NA.
A->B: (A,NA).
B: new NB.
B->s: (A,NA,B,NB).
s: new KAB.
s->B: (scrypt((KAB,NB,A),sk(B,s)),scrypt((NA,B,KAB),sk(A,s))).
B: new NB2.
B->A: (scrypt((NA,B,KAB),sk(A,s)),scrypt(NA,KAB),NB2).
A->B: scrypt(NB2,KAB).

B authenticates s on (KAB,A). #true
A authenticates s on (KAB,B). #true
KAB secret between A B s #true
